{
  "id": "867",
  "title": "Her Mother",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-12-17",
  "synopsis": "Lili is asking Ben about a book. But how is Ben supposed to answer?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/867/5e28d60f6a8b74e5f8567ab027538242aa894e27.mp3?1575901998",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "她的妈妈\n\n丽丽：这是谁的书？\n本：小雨的。不对，今天她的妈妈来了，这本书是她妈的。\n丽丽：“她妈的”？本，不要说“她妈的”，这是一个不好的词。\n本：那我要怎么说？\n丽丽：你可以说：这本书是她妈妈的。\n本：好，我知道了。谢谢你！",
    "traditional": "她的媽媽\n\n麗麗：這是誰的書？\n本：小雨的。不對，今天她的媽媽來了，這本書是她媽的。\n麗麗：“他媽的”？本，不要說“他媽的”，這是一個不好的詞。\n本：那我要怎麼說？\n麗麗：你可以說：這本書是她媽媽的。\n本：好，我知道了。謝謝你！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Her Mother"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：这是谁的书？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：這是誰的書？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zhè shì shéi de shū",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Whose book is this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：小雨的。不对，今天她的妈妈来了，这本书是她妈的。",
      "traditional": "本：小雨的。不對，今天她的媽媽來了，這本書是她媽的。",
      "pinyin": "běn xiǎo yǔ de bú duì jīn tiān tā de mā ma lái le zhè běn shū shì tā mā de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Little Yu’s. No, her mom came today, this book is her mom’s."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：“她妈的”？本，不要说“她妈的”，这是一个不好的词。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：“他媽的”？本，不要說“他媽的”，這是一個不好的詞。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tā mā de běn bú yào shuō tā mā de zhè shì yí ge bù hǎo de cí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: “To hell with it”? Ben, you can’t say “to hell with it”, this is a bad word."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：那我要怎么说？",
      "traditional": "本：那我要怎麼說？",
      "pinyin": "běn nà wǒ yào zěn me shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then how should I say it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你可以说：这本书是她妈妈的。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你可以說：這本書是她媽媽的。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ kě yǐ shuō zhè běn shū shì tā mā ma de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: You can say: This book is her mother’s."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：好，我知道了。谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "本：好，我知道了。謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo wǒ zhī dào le xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok, then I know. Thank you!"
    }
  ],
